From a7e702f2f99a0e1c0caac0246d967be911b91f7e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lina <lokinyauv@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 21:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(i18n): Ukrainian strings for the power buttons and
 the Room page

Adds the Ukrainian text for strings introduced by the other mods ("Turn
on"/"Turn off" from mod/power-buttons-ui, the "Room" page from
mod/play-area). Unused keys are harmless when those mods aren't applied, and
keeping every Ukrainian string here means the other mods don't depend on
this one.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 frontend/src/localization/locales/ua.json | 25 ++++++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 24 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/frontend/src/localization/locales/ua.json b/frontend/src/localization/locales/ua.json
index 5d49d73..caeabc9 100644
--- a/frontend/src/localization/locales/ua.json
+++ b/frontend/src/localization/locales/ua.json
@@ -47,5 +47,28 @@
